Spec: Payment

Path:
  ./backend/payment
  ./frontend/payment
  ./mobile/payment

Flow:
  @flow

DB:
  @db

API:
  @api

Cases:
  @cases

Dependencies:
  Payment
    <- Course
    <- User
    -> PaymentGateway   (external, see project/integrations.sdd)

Note:
  @flow / @db / @api / @cases are references to the sibling files in this
  folder (flow.sdd, db.sdd, api.sdd, cases.sdd). AI opens them only when the
  current stage actually needs them — this is the module-inheritance /
  lazy-load pattern from prompt/new/9.md.
